WEBVTT

00:09:58.571 --> 00:10:01.904
located somewhere
between her sternum and her navel,

00:10:01.928 --> 00:10:05.501
and in every moment,
she would ask it, "Right or left?"

00:10:05.525 --> 00:10:08.357
"Up or down?" "Eat this? Don't eat this?"

00:10:08.381 --> 00:10:10.270
And just trust it.

00:10:10.294 --> 00:10:13.556
Complete, absolute surrender
to the intuition of the moment.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:16.985
And she said it hasn't returned,
the fear hasn't returned,

00:10:17.009 --> 00:10:18.899
and she still guides her life that way.

00:10:18.923 --> 00:10:21.025
So it's a return to some sense

00:10:21.049 --> 00:10:23.220
that there's a navigational
system within you

00:10:23.244 --> 00:10:26.392
that will, if you stay present
in this actual moment,

00:10:26.416 --> 00:10:28.653
tell you what to do
one moment to the next.

00:10:28.677 --> 00:10:30.241
Now, if you want to suffer,